sequenceDiagram
    actor A as Administrador
    participant PS as PedidoService (REQUIRED)
    participant RC as ReglaDeCancelacion
    participant PG as PagoService
    participant RS as RepartidorService
    participant TS as TransportistaService
    participant INV as IReservaStock
    participant RB as ReversasBancarias
    participant CE as CancelacionesDeEnvios
    participant BL as Banco legado
    participant TR as Transportista
    A->>PS: cancelarPedido(id)
    PS->>RC: motivoParaNoCancelar(estado, salioAReparto)
    alt salió a reparto o estado final
        RC-->>PS: motivo
        PS-->>A: CancelacionNoPermitidaException
    else PENDIENTE o CONFIRMADO
        PS->>PG: anularCobro (requiere ADMINISTRADOR)
        PG->>PG: fire CobroAnulado
        PS->>RS: liberarRepartidor
        PS->>TS: cancelarEnvioDePedido
        TS->>TS: fire EnvioCancelado
        PS->>INV: registrarDevolucion (por línea)
        PS->>PS: cambiarEstado(CANCELADO)
        Note over PS: commit
        RB->>BL: reversarPago (AFTER_SUCCESS de CobroAnulado)
        CE->>TR: cancelarEnvio (AFTER_SUCCESS de EnvioCancelado)
    end
